<section class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop pt-24 md:pt-36 pb-20 bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-end">

    <div class="lg:col-span-8">
      <span class="block uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-label-md text-on-surface-variant mb-8">
        Intentional Technology
      </span>

      <h1 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl md:text-[96px] leading-[0.92] tracking-[-0.05em] max-w-5xl">
        Tools for people who want their lives back.
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-4">
      <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        Ziyu Development builds intentional software, hardware concepts, and learning systems designed to help people think clearly, focus deeply, and grow sustainably.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a href="/pages/support" class="bg-primary text-on-primary px-7 py-3 rounded-full">
          Become a Founding Member
        </a>

        <a href="/pages/store" class="border border-outline px-7 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-surface-container">
          View Products
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop pb-24 bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto">
    <div class="aspect-[16/9] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container">
      <img
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366754035-f200968a6e72?q=80&w=2200&auto=format&fit=crop"
        alt="Calm workspace"
        width="2200"
        height="1237"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale"
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-28 bg-surface-container-low">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto">

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter mb-20">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <span class="block uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-label-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6">
          What Ziyu Builds
        </span>

        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg md:text-[64px] leading-tight">
          A calm-tech ecosystem for growth, focus, and reflection.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Some tools are available as early concepts, some are in active development, and some are long-term experiments. The goal is transparency: you should always know what exists now and what is being built.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-gutter">

      <a href="/pages/goal-grower" class="group bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <div class="aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1466692476868-aef1dfb1e735?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Goal Grower" width="1200" height="1500" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700">
        </div>

        <div class="p-6">
          <span class="inline-block bg-primary text-on-primary text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4">
            In Development
          </span>

          <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-2">Goal Grower</h3>

          <p class="text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
            A botanical goal tracker for steady personal growth.
          </p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/myjourney" class="group bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <div class="aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499750310107-5fef28a66643?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="MyJourney" width="1200" height="1500" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700">
        </div>

        <div class="p-6">
          <span class="inline-block border border-outline text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4">
            Concept
          </span>

          <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-2">MyJourney</h3>

          <p class="text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
            A personal archive for goals, habits, memories, and reflection.
          </p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/blokkr" class="group bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <div class="aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516321318423-f06f85e504b3?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Blokkr" width="1200" height="1500" class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700">
        </div>

        <div class="p-6">
          <span class="inline-block border border-outline text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4">
            Hardware Experiment
          </span>

          <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-2">Blokkr</h3>

          <p class="text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
            A physical device concept for entering deep work.
          </p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/kindlitt" class="group bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <div class="aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512820790803-83ca734da794?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="KindLitt" width="1200" height="1500" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700">
        </div>

        <div class="p-6">
          <span class="inline-block border border-outline text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4">
            Future Product
          </span>

          <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-2">KindLitt</h3>

          <p class="text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
            A calmer reading experience for families and focused learning.
          </p>
        </div>
      </a>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-32 bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-start">

    <div class="lg:col-span-5">
      <span class="block uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-label-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6">
        Why It Exists
      </span>

      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg md:text-[64px] leading-tight">
        Modern technology is loud. Ziyu is built to be quiet.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-8 text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Most apps are designed to pull people back in. Ziyu Development is an attempt to build the opposite: tools that help people finish, reflect, close the screen, and return to real life.
      </p>

      <p>
        This site is both a store and an archive. The store shows what is being built. The archive explains the philosophy, roadmap, changelog, and learning behind it.
      </p>

      <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a href="/pages/philosophy" class="bg-primary text-on-primary px-7 py-3 rounded-full">
          Read Philosophy
        </a>

        <a href="/pages/journal" class="border border-outline px-7 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-surface-container">
          Read Build Notes
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-32 bg-primary text-on-primary">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-gutter items-center">

    <div>
      <span class="block uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-label-md opacity-70 mb-6">
        Founding Member Access
      </span>

      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg md:text-[72px] leading-tight">
        Support the creation of intentional tools.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="text-body-lg opacity-80 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        Becoming a founding member helps fund product development, infrastructure, writing, and experiments without forcing Ziyu to become another attention-driven platform.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a href="/pages/support" class="bg-surface text-on-surface px-7 py-3 rounded-full">
          Become a Founding Member
        </a>

        <a href="/pages/roadmap" class="border border-white/30 px-7 py-3 rounded-full">
          View Roadmap
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

